    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Barbie has had many jobs and looks. Now, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "for the first time",
            "ref": "v-first"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", there is a Barbie with type 1 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "diabetes",
            "zh": "1型糖尿病"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "illness",
            "ref": "v-illness"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " makes a person’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blood",
            "ref": "v-blood"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " have too much sugar."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The new Barbie wears things that people with this illness use every day. She has a blood sugar "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "monitor",
            "zh": "检测仪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on her arm. It helps check how much sugar there is in her blood. She also has an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "insulin pump",
            "zh": "胰岛素泵"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on her waist. It gives the right amount of insulin after checking her sugar level. They work together to help her stay healthy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The doll wears a blue "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "top",
            "ref": "v-top"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and skirt with dots. Blue and dots are signs for diabetes care around the world. The toy company hopes this doll will help children with diabetes "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "feel good about themselves"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Model Lila Moss has type 1 diabetes, too. She was the first to meet the new doll. “I like seeing the same tools I use every day on the doll. They help make my life easier and I don’t need to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hide",
            "ref": "v-hide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them,” she said."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
